src:ACTIONS-3931: This message fires if you `ARREST BAXTER AND DUNBAR` between 10:00 and 11:40 am. It shouldn’t be necessary, as it’s not possible to get the [~obj:BAXTER-PAPERS] before the will reading, but I guess they wanted to be careful.
